d the actin cytoskeleton during polarized morphogenesis</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1997</year><volume>276</volume><fpage>118</fpage><lpage>122</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9082982</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heim</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Cubitt</surname><given-names>AB</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsien</surname><given-names>RY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Improved green fluorescence</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1995</year><volume>373</volume><fpage>663</fpage><lpage>664</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7854443</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Holy</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name><name><surname>Leibler</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dynamic instability of microtubules as an efficient way to search in space</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>1994</year><volume>91</volume><fpage>5682</fpage><lpage>5685</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8202548</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Huffaker</surname><given-names>TC</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Botstein</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Diverse effects of &#x003b2;-tubulin mutations on microtubule formation and function</article-title><source>J Cell Biol</source><year>1988</year><volume>106</volume><fpage>1997</fpage><lpage>2010</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3290223</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hyman</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name></